'''Heavy Helmet''' (Japanese: '''ヘビーメット''' ''Heavy Helmet'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=If the Pokémon this card is attached to has a Retreat Cost of 3 or more, it takes –&NoBreak;20 damage from attacks from your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
===Origin===
* This card's artwork alludes to the [[Heavy Ball]] in the [[Pokémon games]]. In the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], the {{TCG|Heavy Ball}} card searches for Pokémon cards whose Retreat Cost is 3 or more.

